  npcName: Stranger
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 84e0f52af585a0e49961b8f502f64c7d, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - ...Stranger... come... this way...
  - This land has not seen living breath in ages... Stranger, who are you? Where
    do you come from?
  - Judging by your attire... perhaps you are... a musician?
  - Then maybe you can help. Music revitalizes us plants.
  - We used to live in peace in prosperity. But one night...
  - The stars fell from the sky... They spread a sickness across our lands, corrupting
    everything it touched.
  - If you go to the cave to the left, you will reach the corrupted land.
  - Go now. Perhaps you can still save this world...
